<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PJ America started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PJ America started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it initiated coverage of PJ America Inc as a near and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- PJ America gained 1 to 16-1/4.</p>
